From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ole Algoritme <olealgoritme@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 02:27:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] nvk/rm: compress separate depth/stencil images by default
 (NVK_RM_COMPRESS_ZS)

Blackwell splits D24S8 and D32S8X24 into separate depth and stencil
planes, and patch 0012 compresses both planes only behind
NVK_RM_COMPRESS_ZS=1.  D3D games through DXVK and vkd3d-proton use those
formats for almost every depth buffer, so their depth tests and writes
ran uncompressed.

RTX 5090, d3d11_gpupass (Conduit guest/windows/tools), 5120x1440, 8x
MSAA, D24S8, reverse Z, 2000 draws: depth prepass 762 us -> 510 us GPU.
With it on, d3d11_depth_views_probe (layer, mip, layered and re-created
views, D32 and D24S8, 1x and 4x) matches in every case, and
d3d11_msaa_probe matches in its 1x/4x/8x D32 and D24S8 cases (resolves,
second-part loads, Texture2DMS loads of color and depth).

On by default; NVK_RM_COMPRESS_ZS=0 turns it off.
---
 src/nouveau/vulkan/nvkmd/rm/nvkmd_rm_pdev.c | 9 ++++++---
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvkmd/rm/nvkmd_rm_pdev.c b/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvkmd/rm/nvkmd_rm_pdev.c
index ae1302a..7b9b5b7 100644
--- a/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvkmd/rm/nvkmd_rm_pdev.c
+++ b/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvkmd/rm/nvkmd_rm_pdev.c
@@ -461,12 +461,15 @@ nvkmd_rm_try_create_pdev(const struct nvkmd_rm_lib *lib,
 
    /* Combined depth/stencil formats are two planes on Blackwell, which NVK
     * leaves uncompressed.  GB20x has only generic kinds, so each plane is
-    * compressed like any other image (nvk_image.c).  Off by default while
-    * it is measured.
+    * compressed like any other image (nvk_image.c).  D3D games through DXVK
+    * and vkd3d-proton use D24S8 and D32S8 depth buffers, so without this
+    * their depth tests and writes run at full, uncompressed bandwidth: an
+    * 8x MSAA D24S8 depth prepass at 5120x1440 took 762 us uncompressed and
+    * 510 us compressed.  NVK_RM_COMPRESS_ZS=0 turns it off.
     */
    pdev->base.kmd_info.has_zs_compression =
       pdev->base.kmd_info.has_compression &&
-      debug_get_bool_option("NVK_RM_COMPRESS_ZS", false);
+      debug_get_bool_option("NVK_RM_COMPRESS_ZS", true);
 
    /* VRAM is allocated with 64 KiB pages; system memory BOs get their own
     * 4 KiB bind alignment (nvkmd_mem::bind_align_B).
-- 
